Package: FastHer
Title: Fast Local Heritability Estimation from GWAS Summary Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gulnara", "Svishcheva", email = "gulsvi@mail.ru", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the FastHer method for local heritability estimation
    using REML function optimized by eigen-decomposition of LD matrix.
